(107, 'reel-leonida', 'Leonida in motion: official character clips', 'video', 'Homepage reel: muted loop, scroll-aware.', 'https://www.rockstargames.com/VI/media/videos', NULL, 'clips/leonida-reel.mp4', 'Copyright Rockstar Games / Take-Two Interactive.', 'permission_required', 'pending_review', 'Built locally from Rockstar''s eight official character clips (each 1 to 1.5 seconds), cut into one muted 9 second reel. The file lives in the Git-ignored media/ folder and is never committed. Rockstar invites visitors to download and share these clips but states no licence terms, so a human should confirm. The site shows the reel only when the file exists.')
